        "text_bmYbaa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Co-Founder & CEO, Kelsey Selby, a Gen Z California native, spent years inside the hospitality world she loved before recognizing a gap — something missing for her generation.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_VHtdMa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A generation of people who had already redefined how they eat, where they shop, what they put in their bodies, and a tequila category that had not caught up. They were still selling heritage and legacy to people who were asking a different question entirely: is it honest? Is it clean? Does it belong to my life?</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "position": "left",
